step Tanaris Field Sampling
  tip Just south of Gadgetzan the Blisterpaw Hyenas, Glasshide Basilisks and Scorpid Hunters share the dunes. Each can drop an untested sample: use it, and it either passes as an acceptable one or is lost. Keep killing until you have eight of each.
  collect 9441 quest 654.2 @50.2,31.6 map 1446
