step Scrimshank's gear
  tip Further south, Junior Surveyor Scrimshank's gear lies at the mouth of a Centipaar hive.
  tip Careful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds.
  collect 8593 quest 10.1 @56.0,71.2  -- Below ground

step OOX-17/TN
  tip Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.
  tip Careful: The escort has two ambushes. Three level 47 scorpids attack near the start. Near the end, by the beach, three Wastewander humans attack: one mage and two assassins, around level 44.
  accept 351 optional
  turnin 351 optional                   -- Homing Robot OOX-17/TN
  accept 648 optional
  complete 648 optional

